#: lib/ClustersPage.php
msgid "Client commands use the binaries set under Settings > HPC Scheduler and the poller user's own Slurm authentication; the optional slurm.conf path selects a cluster. slurmrestd fields are used only with that transport. The token file must be readable by the poller user only; the plugin reads it at each run and never stores the token."
msgstr "Klijentske komande koriste binarne datoteke podešene pod Postavke > HPC Scheduler i sopstvenu Slurm autentifikaciju korisnika pollera; opcionalna putanja do slurm.conf bira klaster. Polja za slurmrestd koriste se samo s tim transportom. Datoteka tokena mora biti čitljiva samo korisniku pollera; dodatak je čita pri svakom pokretanju i nikada ne pohranjuje token."

