#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Data Parser"
msgstr "Parser podataka"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Slurm data parser for the client commands. Choose one that the release of every cluster read through client commands ships: v0.0.43 is in 25.05, 25.11, and 26.05 and is removed in 27.05; v0.0.44 needs 25.11 or later; v0.0.45 needs 26.05 or later. The health page warns when a cluster reports a release without it. Clusters read through slurmrestd ignore this setting: they use the newest of these the daemon serves, and the health page shows which."
msgstr "Slurm parser podataka za klijentske komande. Odaberite onaj koji isporučuje izdanje svakog klastera koji se čita putem klijentskih komandi: v0.0.43 nalazi se u 25.05, 25.11 i 26.05 te se uklanja u 27.05; v0.0.44 zahtijeva 25.11 ili novije; v0.0.45 zahtijeva 26.05 ili novije. Stranica stanja sistema upozorava kada klaster prijavi izdanje bez njega. Klasteri koji se čitaju putem slurmrestd zanemaruju ovu postavku: koriste najnoviji koji demon nudi, a stranica stanja sistema prikazuje koji."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to squeue on each poller that reads a cluster through client commands. The plugin runs it only as squeue --all --json with the data parser above."
msgstr "Apsolutna putanja do squeue na svakom polleru koji čita klaster putem klijentskih komandi. Dodatak ga pokreće samo kao squeue --all --json s gornjim parserom podataka."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "squeue"
msgstr "squeue"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to scontrol. The plugin runs only scontrol --json show node, show partition, and show reservation; never update, reconfigure, or token."
msgstr "Apsolutna putanja do scontrol. Dodatak pokreće samo scontrol --json show node, show partition i show reservation; nikada update, reconfigure ili token."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "scontrol"
msgstr "scontrol"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to sshare, used only for clusters that collect fair-share."
msgstr "Apsolutna putanja do sshare, koristi se samo za klastere koji prikupljaju fair-share."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "sshare"
msgstr "sshare"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Ograničenja"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Call Timeout"
msgstr "Vremensko ograničenje poziva"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one scheduler call may take before it is stopped and its section recorded as failed. A call never runs past the reader time budget either."
msgstr "Broj sekundi koliko jedan poziv planera smije trajati prije nego što bude zaustavljen, a njegova sekcija zabilježena kao neuspjela. Poziv također nikada ne prelazi vremenski budžet čitača."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Maximum Answer Size"
msgstr "Maksimalna veličina odgovora"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB one scheduler call may return. A larger answer is discarded and its section recorded as failed. Decoding needs about 12 times the answer size, so the reader uses at most (Collection Memory - 64) / 12 MiB and the health page warns when this value is larger."
msgstr "Broj MiB koje jedan poziv planera smije vratiti. Veći odgovor se odbacuje, a njegova sekcija bilježi kao neuspjela. Dekodiranje zahtijeva oko 12 puta više memorije od veličine odgovora, pa čitač koristi najviše (Memorija za prikupljanje - 64) / 12 MiB, a stranica stanja sistema upozorava kada je ova vrijednost veća."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collection Memory"
msgstr "Memorija za prikupljanje"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of PHP memory each collection run raises its limit to (it never lowers one). The default of 1024 fits answers up to 80 MiB."
msgstr "Broj MiB PHP memorije na koji svako prikupljanje podiže svoje ograničenje (nikada ga ne snižava). Podrazumijevana vrijednost od 1024 dovoljna je za odgovore do 80 MiB."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to prlimit (util-linux), used to cap the address space of each client command. Leave empty to run commands without a memory limit; the health page then warns."
msgstr "Apsolutna putanja do prlimit (util-linux), koja ograničava adresni prostor svake klijentske komande. Ostavite prazno da se komande pokreću bez ograničenja memorije; stranica stanja sistema tada upozorava."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "prlimit"
msgstr "prlimit"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Command Memory Limit"
msgstr "Ograničenje memorije komande"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "MiB of address space each client command may use, through prlimit."
msgstr "Broj MiB adresnog prostora koji svaka klijentska komanda smije koristiti putem alata prlimit."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Credentials"
msgstr "Kredencijali za slurmrestd"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token File Directories"
msgstr "Direktoriji za datoteke tokena"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute directories on the pollers that may hold slurmrestd token files, separated by commas or spaces. A cluster can name only a token file inside one of them, owned by the poller user and reached without a symbolic link. Keep each directory writable only by root and the poller user. Empty means no cluster can use slurmrestd."
msgstr "Apsolutni direktoriji na pollerima koji smiju sadržavati datoteke tokena za slurmrestd, odvojeni zarezima ili razmacima. Klaster smije navesti samo datoteku tokena unutar jednog od njih, u vlasništvu korisnika pollera i dostupnu bez simboličke veze. Svaki direktorij mora biti otvoren za upis samo korisniku root i korisniku pollera. Prazno znači da nijedan klaster ne može koristiti slurmrestd."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "slurmrestd Hosts"
msgstr "slurmrestd hostovi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Optional. The slurmrestd hosts a cluster may name, as host or host:port, separated by commas or spaces. An entry without a port allows any port on that host. Empty allows any host."
msgstr "Opcionalno. Hostovi za slurmrestd koje klaster smije navesti, u obliku host ili host:port, odvojeni zarezima ili razmacima. Unos bez porta dozvoljava bilo koji port na tom hostu. Prazno dozvoljava bilo koji host."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds before a token expires when the health page starts to warn, if the token carries an expiry time."
msgstr "Broj sekundi prije isteka tokena kada stranica stanja sistema počinje upozoravati, ako token sadrži vrijeme isteka."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Token Expiry Warning"
msgstr "Upozorenje o isteku tokena"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Deinstalacija"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Zadrži tabele dodatka pri deinstalaciji"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its clusters and snapshots. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them; export the clusters first from HPC Clusters. The plugin creates no Cacti devices or Maint schedules in this release, and the scheduler is never contacted either way."
msgstr "Kada je označeno, deinstalacija dodatka zadržava njegove klastere i snimke. Isključite ovu opciju da ih deinstalacija obriše; prvo izvezite klastere sa stranice HPC klasteri. Dodatak u ovom izdanju ne kreira Cacti uređaje niti Maint rasporede, a planer se ni u jednom slučaju ne kontaktira."

